    <string name="fonts_delete_confirm">Tap again to delete</string>
    <string name="fonts_manage_note">Turning a font off first returns each use to its default. The tablet returns to the font it had before BooxUltimatum changed it, or to the Boox default. The home screen follows the tablet font, BooxUltimatum returns to Archivo, and the sleep screen uses the tablet font. The files then move to app storage and leave the Boox fonts folder and Documents, so nothing offers the font. Turning it on puts the files back and restores those uses unless you chose something else. Delete restores the same uses, then removes every copy BooxUltimatum made.</string>
